
# <type>(<scope>)!: <summary>    (<=72 chars, imperative, no trailing period)
#
# types: feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# scope: optional lowercase area, e.g. engine, solver, automation, ci
# !    : breaking change (or add a "BREAKING CHANGE: ..." line in the body)
#
# Body (optional, wrapped at 72): what changed and why.
# Blank line between subject and body is required.
#
# Footer: "Closes #<issue>" when this resolves an issue.
